# Saga Drift (CIPlay saga_drift): the gangway, the charter, the screechers, the smelter yard, the council minutes, the
# rats, the rendering house, the chapel keypad (1909) and strongbox, the winch locker, the last sermon.
island Saga Drift
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Floating City
zone gangway
expect step 1
read City charter
expect step 2
kill Screecher
expect step 3
open Smelter yard chest
wait 3
expect step 4
read Council cabin minutes
expect step 5
zone council
kill Rat
expect step 6
open Rendering house chest
wait 3
expect step 7
code chapelpad 1909
expect story chapelcode 1
open Chapel strongbox
wait 3
expect step 8
# DEEP 10-24: the berg cave's ledger, the crane on the berg, the pawl
zone berg_cave
read Harbour master's ledger
expect step 9
zone crane_top
expect step 10
open Crane cab chest
wait 3
expect story pawl 1
expect step 11
expect hidden anchorchest
use anchorwinch
expect story winchfree 0
use bell1
use bell2
use bell3
expect story bellrung 3
expect step 12
use anchorwinch
expect story bellrung 0
expect story pawl 0
expect shown anchorchest
expect step 13
open Winch locker
wait 3
expect step 14
read Last sermon
expect done
# the extras: the harbour office chest, the net loft, the tenth ship, three treasures
open Harbour office chest
read Net mender's note
open Net loft crate
zone tenth_ship
air tenthair
open Tenth ship's strongbox
dig 0
dig 1
dig 2
